# SSH server for the Azure App Service console (see docker/entrypoint.sh). Settings follow Microsoft's
# "Enable SSH" guidance for custom Linux containers: port 2222, root login with the fixed password.
Port                    2222
ListenAddress           0.0.0.0
LoginGraceTime          180
StrictModes             yes
SyslogFacility          DAEMON
PasswordAuthentication  yes
PermitEmptyPasswords    no
PermitRootLogin         yes
X11Forwarding           no
Ciphers                 aes128-ctr,aes192-ctr,aes256-ctr
MACs                    hmac-sha2-256,hmac-sha2-512,hmac-sha1
Subsystem               sftp internal-sftp
